WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.872
"Oh no!" Sid said.

2
00:00:04.873 --> 00:00:10.711
He looked at the broken tree.

3
00:00:10.712 --> 00:00:19.864
"Now we can't play."

4
00:00:19.865 --> 00:00:22.558
Tor reached into her bag.

5
00:00:22.559 --> 00:00:25.148
She pulled out seeds.

6
00:00:25.149 --> 00:00:34.089
"I'll plant a new tree!"

7
00:00:34.090 --> 00:00:38.406
Rex laughed.

8
00:00:38.407 --> 00:00:43.508
"That won't help us, Tor!"

9
00:00:43.509 --> 00:00:52.266
Sid looked sad.

10
00:00:52.267 --> 00:00:55.036
Sara picked up the vine.

11
00:00:55.037 --> 00:01:01.280
"Sid, swing with me," she said.

12
00:01:01.281 --> 00:01:07.839
Sara and Sid swung the vine.

13
00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:14.049
Rex and Tor clapped.

14
00:01:14.050 --> 00:01:19.619
Rex jumped the vine.

15
00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:22.086
The vine hit his foot!

16
00:01:22.087 --> 00:01:27.009
"Whoops!" Rex laughed.

17
00:01:27.010 --> 00:01:34.940
Next, Tor jumped.

18
00:01:34.941 --> 00:01:40.623
Sid wanted another turn.

19
00:01:40.624 --> 00:01:48.193
Rex and Sara swung the vine.

20
00:01:48.194 --> 00:01:51.268
Sid held his tail and jumped.

21
00:01:51.269 --> 00:01:54.307
"Whee!" he said.

22
00:01:54.308 --> 00:01:58.307
"This is so much fun!" Sid said.

23
00:01:58.308 --> 00:02:00.681
He forgot about his tail.

24
00:02:00.682 --> 00:02:02.428
He let go.

25
00:02:02.429 --> 00:02:04.660
Sid's tail swung.

26
00:02:04.661 --> 00:02:07.708
"The vine!" Tor said.

27
00:02:07.709 --> 00:02:15.989
"It's tangled again!"

28
00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:20.157
Rex laughed.

29
00:02:20.158 --> 00:02:21.466
"That's okay.

30
00:02:21.467 --> 00:02:31.384
We're having fun!"

